  "full_response": "I'm really sorry to hear that you're feeling this way. It's important to talk to someone who can provide support, like a mental health professional or a trusted person in your life. If you're in crisis or thinking about harming yourself, please contact a local crisis hotline or emergency services immediately. Here are a few general resources that might be helpful:\n\n- **Crisis Hotlines**: These are confidential and available 24/7. You can find specific numbers for your country or region online.\n- **Encourage Professional Help**: Consider reaching out to a therapist or counselor.\n- **Support Networks**: Talk to family or friends who care about you.\n\nYour life is valuable, and there are people who care about you and want to help you through this tough time. Please reach out to someone who can provide support.",
